  "title": "2 Bed + 2 Bath @ Fourth + Mac — Kitsilano | Available October 1 - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted 5 days ago\n\nprint\n$4,350 / 2br - 801ft2 - 2 Bed + 2 Bath @ Fourth + Mac — Kitsilano | Available October 1 (Vancouver)\nFourth Avenue, Vancouver, BC V6K0J1\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\nFourth Avenue near Macdonald Street\n2BR / 2Ba 801ft2 available oct 1\nrent period: monthly\ncats are OK - purrr\napartment\ndogs are OK - wooof\nw/d in unit\nattached garage\nno smoking\nair conditioning\nEV charging\nLive at Fourth + Mac in this spacious 801 sqft two-bedroom, two-bathroom home featuring city and water views, a private balcony, air conditioning and flexible in-suite storage/worksapce. Located at West 4th Ave and Macdonald Street , Fourth + Mac puts you steps from Fresh Street Market, Shoppers Drug Mart, cafés, restaurants, fitness studios, transit and some of Kitsilano's best beaches.\n\nHome Features\n• City + water views\n• Full size appliance package\n• Individual air conditioning\n• In suite flex room for storage or workspace\n• Private balcony\n• Under cabinet LED lighting\n• Medicine cabinet in bathroom\n• In suite laundry\n\nParking Available for Rent\n\nNeighborhood\n• West 4th retail, restaurants, cafés, fitness studios\n• Easy access to bus routes 44 & 84 (UBC + downtown)\n• Beaches within minutes\n\nBuilding Features\n• Zero carbon operations\n• 100% smoke free\n• Keyless entry + FOB access\n• Professionally managed by Third Space\n• Secure parcel lockers\n• Pet friendly\n• Storage lockers available\n\nAmenities\n• The Hub — lobby + co working space with flexible work areas\n• The Lounge — social lounge with big screen TV, pool table, and outdoor patio\n• The Roof — rooftop with BBQ stations, dining zone, garden plots, play areas, and lounge spaces\n• Dedicated wash room for sandy paws + muddy bikes\n• High speed Wi Fi in most amenity spaces\n\nVideos:\nhttps://youtube.com/@basepoint-x4e?si=PSD7d8IxlrwlAxJ4\n\n\n\npost id: 7965071439\n\n \n\nposted: 5 days ago\n\n \n\nupdated: about 12 hours ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
